Object.assign(window.BODY=window.BODY||{},{"bf11": "<h2 id=\"第-11-法-众鬼虽彰全不畏-救神御侮\">第 11 法　众鬼虽彰全不畏：救神御侮</h2>\n<blockquote><p><strong>注</strong>　虽有乌合之敌众，难当虎豹之雄师</p></blockquote>\n<h3 id=\"众鬼不惧格-有惊无险\">众鬼不惧格：有惊无险</h3>\n<blockquote class=\"cite\"><p><q class=\"yw\">假令壬辰日戌加未为初传，丑加戌为中传，辰加丑为末传，三传戌丑辰皆是日鬼，诚为凶也。殊不知干上先有寅木可以敌其三传之土，制鬼贼不能为害，兼是萬矢择比为用，又坐空乡，鬼力至轻也。凡占未免先值惊危，下稍无畏，但言必有人相谋害，终不能为祸也。如用夜贵，初乘白虎，尚可畏焉。如用日贵，全无畏矣。且论寅木切不可作脱气言之，实为救神，其寅木论如孔氏门下有子路能御侮者也。</q> <span class=\"src\">〔大全三·第 11 法〕</span></p></blockquote>\n<p><strong>白话</strong>　三传皆鬼、或为鬼局，名全彰。子孙为克鬼之神，如临干为救神、护我之神，可以克鬼。故课中三传皆鬼、干上神乘子孙，便为有救，不怕鬼克。如壬辰日第十局，壬水干上乘寅，三传戌丑辰虽为日鬼，但干上神寅木作子孙、克鬼护干，日干不受克，鬼贼不能为害。此时寅木不可作脱气论、而为救神，就像孔子门下的子路一样能御侮。占事逢此，虽先有惊而后无畏，即使有人相害也不会有灾祸。（用日贵全无畏，用夜贵初乘白虎尚可畏。）</p>\n<p><strong>盘</strong>　壬辰日第 10 局　月将 午 加占时 卯　（遥克·蒿矢）</p>\n<div class=\"panwrap\"><div class=\"pan\"><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">申</span><span class=\"dp\">巳</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">酉</span><span class=\"dp\">午</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">戌</span><span class=\"dp\">未</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">亥</span><span class=\"dp\">申</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">子</span><span class=\"dp\">酉</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">丑</span><span class=\"dp\">戌</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">寅</span><span class=\"dp\">亥</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">卯</span><span class=\"dp\">子</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">辰</span><span class=\"dp\">丑</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">巳</span><span class=\"dp\">寅</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">午</span><span class=\"dp\">卯</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">未</span><span class=\"dp\">辰</span></div><div class=\"panmid\"></div></div></div>\n<p><strong>四课</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sike\"><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第四课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">戌</span><span class=\"dn w-tu\">未</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第三课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">未</span><span class=\"dn w-tu\">辰</span><span class=\"nt\">日支</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第二课</span><span class=\"up w-huo\">巳</span><span class=\"dn w-mu\">寅</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第一课</span><span class=\"up w-mu\">寅</span><span class=\"dn w-shui\">壬</span><span class=\"nt\">日干，寄亥</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>三传</strong>　<strong>戌 → 丑 → 辰</strong></p>\n<blockquote><p>原书注：众鬼不惧格 · 壬辰日第十局，干上寅木作子孙救神制鬼</p></blockquote>\n<h3 id=\"家鬼取家人-家鬼克害\">家鬼取家人：家鬼克害</h3>\n<blockquote class=\"cite\"><p><q class=\"yw\">家鬼取家人，如己丑日干上申，支上寅为用，三传寅卯辰，如用夜贵，必得贵人解救。自支寅木发用，中末传俱归木乡，凡值支上有鬼，引入鬼乡者，皆如此说。如丙申日干上丑，丙寅日干上辰，从支阴发用为鬼，亦以家鬼断，赖干上有救，有官人可，病讼凶。</q> <span class=\"src\">〔大全三·第 11 法〕</span></p></blockquote>\n<p><strong>白话</strong>　家鬼取家人，如己丑日第十二局，干上为申、支上为寅、寅为用，三传寅卯辰，如用夜贵必得贵人解救。自支寅木发用、中末传俱归木乡。凡支上有鬼、引入鬼乡者皆属此例。如丙申日第五局干上丑、丙寅日第二局干上辰，支之阴神发用为鬼，亦断为家鬼。若干上神克制作救神，有官者尚可，占病讼则凶。</p>\n<p><strong>盘</strong>　己丑日第 12 局　月将 子 加占时 亥　（元首）</p>\n<div class=\"panwrap\"><div class=\"pan\"><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">午</span><span class=\"dp\">巳</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">未</span><span class=\"dp\">午</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">申</span><span class=\"dp\">未</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">酉</span><span class=\"dp\">申</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">戌</span><span class=\"dp\">酉</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">亥</span><span class=\"dp\">戌</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">子</span><span class=\"dp\">亥</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">丑</span><span class=\"dp\">子</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">寅</span><span class=\"dp\">丑</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">卯</span><span class=\"dp\">寅</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">辰</span><span class=\"dp\">卯</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">巳</span><span class=\"dp\">辰</span></div><div class=\"panmid\"></div></div></div>\n<p><strong>四课</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sike\"><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第四课</span><span class=\"up w-mu\">卯</span><span class=\"dn w-mu\">寅</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第三课</span><span class=\"up w-mu\">寅</span><span class=\"dn w-tu\">丑</span><span class=\"nt\">日支</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第二课</span><span class=\"up w-jin\">酉</span><span class=\"dn w-jin\">申</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第一课</span><span class=\"up w-jin\">申</span><span class=\"dn w-tu\">己</span><span class=\"nt\">日干，寄未</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>三传</strong>　<strong>寅 → 卯 → 辰</strong></p>\n<blockquote><p>原书注：家鬼取家人 · 己丑日第十二局夜占，支上寅木引入鬼乡</p></blockquote>\n<h3 id=\"家人解祸格-家人解救\">家人解祸格：家人解救</h3>\n<blockquote class=\"cite\"><p><q class=\"yw\">家人解祸格，如癸亥日辰加癸为用，三传辰未戌皆是土神，并来伤干，兼夜天将皆是蛇勾虎，诚为凶也。殊不知支上有寅木可以敌鬼，不为凶咎，此例必得宅中之人解祸，余仿此。</q> <span class=\"src\">〔大全三·第 11 法〕</span></p></blockquote>\n<p><strong>白话</strong>　三传皆鬼、干上神不能解救，救神却临支上，主家中有人能解其祸，故称家人解祸格。如癸亥日第十局，辰土作鬼墓、临干发用，三传辰未戌都是土神、皆鬼克日干，且夜里天将都是蛇勾虎，极为凶险。但支上神寅木能敌土鬼、使其不能为祸、为救神。此课局即为家人解祸格。</p>\n<p><strong>盘</strong>　癸亥日第 10 局　月将 卯 加占时 子　（元首）</p>\n<div class=\"panwrap\"><div class=\"pan\"><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">申</span><span class=\"dp\">巳</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">酉</span><span class=\"dp\">午</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">戌</span><span class=\"dp\">未</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">亥</span><span class=\"dp\">申</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">子</span><span class=\"dp\">酉</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">丑</span><span class=\"dp\">戌</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">寅</span><span class=\"dp\">亥</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">卯</span><span class=\"dp\">子</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">辰</span><span class=\"dp\">丑</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">巳</span><span class=\"dp\">寅</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">午</span><span class=\"dp\">卯</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">未</span><span class=\"dp\">辰</span></div><div class=\"panmid\"></div></div></div>\n<p><strong>四课</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sike\"><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第四课</span><span class=\"up w-huo\">巳</span><span class=\"dn w-mu\">寅</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第三课</span><span class=\"up w-mu\">寅</span><span class=\"dn w-shui\">亥</span><span class=\"nt\">日支</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第二课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">未</span><span class=\"dn w-tu\">辰</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第一课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">辰</span><span class=\"dn w-shui\">癸</span><span class=\"nt\">日干，寄丑</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>三传</strong>　<strong>辰 → 未 → 戌</strong></p>\n<blockquote><p>原书注：家人解祸格 · 癸亥日第十局夜占，支上寅木为救神解鬼</p></blockquote>\n<h3 id=\"引鬼为生格-先凶后吉\">引鬼为生格：先凶后吉</h3>\n<blockquote class=\"cite\"><p><q class=\"yw\">引鬼为生格，谓初传日鬼，而生其末传来育干者是也。如丙子日并干上子为初传，虽是鬼却生末传寅木，作丙火之长生，反不畏干上之子水，亦赖宅上未土为救，是丙子日是也。丙午日亦有丑土为救也，余不为救。己丑日卯加申，甲寅、甲午日酉加寅，乃先凶后吉。</q> <span class=\"src\">〔大全三·第 11 法〕</span></p></blockquote>\n<p><strong>白话</strong>　初传为日鬼、末传为日之父母，鬼虽克身、但生父母，鬼生父母、父母生干，故称引鬼为生格。占事逢此，主先凶后吉、先难后易。如丙子日第六局，干上子为初传，虽是日鬼、却生末传寅木、作丙火之长生，反不畏干上子水，又有宅上未土为救，这是丙子日。丙午日第六局也有丑土为救。己丑日第六局、甲寅日第六局、甲午日第六局，均主先凶后吉。</p>\n<p><strong>盘</strong>　丙子日第 6 局　月将 子 加占时 巳　（涉害·见机）</p>\n<div class=\"panwrap\"><div class=\"pan\"><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">子</span><span class=\"dp\">巳</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">丑</span><span class=\"dp\">午</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">寅</span><span class=\"dp\">未</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">卯</span><span class=\"dp\">申</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">辰</span><span class=\"dp\">酉</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">巳</span><span class=\"dp\">戌</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">午</span><span class=\"dp\">亥</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">未</span><span class=\"dp\">子</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">申</span><span class=\"dp\">丑</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">酉</span><span class=\"dp\">寅</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">戌</span><span class=\"dp\">卯</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">亥</span><span class=\"dp\">辰</span></div><div class=\"panmid\"></div></div></div>\n<p><strong>四课</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sike\"><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第四课</span><span class=\"up w-mu\">寅</span><span class=\"dn w-tu\">未</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第三课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">未</span><span class=\"dn w-shui\">子</span><span class=\"nt\">日支</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第二课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">未</span><span class=\"dn w-shui\">子</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第一课</span><span class=\"up w-shui\">子</span><span class=\"dn w-huo\">丙</span><span class=\"nt\">日干，寄巳</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>三传</strong>　<strong>子 → 未 → 寅</strong></p>\n<blockquote><p>原书注：引鬼为生格 · 丙子日第六局，初鬼子生末传寅、寅为丙长生</p></blockquote>\n<h3 id=\"传鬼为生格-逢凶化吉\">传鬼为生格：逢凶化吉</h3>\n<blockquote class=\"cite\"><p><q class=\"yw\">传鬼为生格，三传皆作日鬼，反生起干上之神而育干者是也。如庚午日干上辰，三传戌午寅火局，虽全伤日干，殊不知三传反生干上辰土而育养庚金也。又癸巳日巳加酉，用昼将皆土克日，殊不知土将生三传金局，三传金局生干，乃凶返吉也。</q> <span class=\"src\">〔大全三·第 11 法〕</span></p></blockquote>\n<p><strong>白话</strong>　三传均日鬼、干上神却生干。鬼虽克干、但生干上神之父母，父母再生干，故叫传鬼为生。占事得此，主逢凶化吉、转祸为福。如庚午日第五局干上辰，三传寅午戌合成火局为鬼、克干，但辰土生庚金为父母、临干上，火鬼生辰土、辰土生日干，属传鬼为生格。再如癸巳日第九局，三传乘贵人、勾陈、太常均土将、克日干癸水，但三传合化金局、金生水，为父母化鬼生干，亦属此格，主化凶为吉。</p>\n<p><strong>盘</strong>　庚午日第 5 局　月将 亥 加占时 卯　（涉害）</p>\n<div class=\"panwrap\"><div class=\"pan\"><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">丑</span><span class=\"dp\">巳</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">寅</span><span class=\"dp\">午</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">卯</span><span class=\"dp\">未</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">辰</span><span class=\"dp\">申</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">巳</span><span class=\"dp\">酉</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">午</span><span class=\"dp\">戌</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">未</span><span class=\"dp\">亥</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">申</span><span class=\"dp\">子</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">酉</span><span class=\"dp\">丑</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">戌</span><span class=\"dp\">寅</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">亥</span><span class=\"dp\">卯</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">子</span><span class=\"dp\">辰</span></div><div class=\"panmid\"></div></div></div>\n<p><strong>四课</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sike\"><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第四课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">戌</span><span class=\"dn w-mu\">寅</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第三课</span><span class=\"up w-mu\">寅</span><span class=\"dn w-huo\">午</span><span class=\"nt\">日支</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第二课</span><span class=\"up w-shui\">子</span><span class=\"dn w-tu\">辰</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第一课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">辰</span><span class=\"dn w-jin\">庚</span><span class=\"nt\">日干，寄申</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>三传</strong>　<strong>子 → 申 → 辰</strong></p>\n<blockquote class=\"cite\"><p><span class=\"src\">〔订正〕</span>原存三传 <strong>戌→午→寅</strong>，按《通解》复算应为 <strong>子→申→辰</strong>（涉害；分歧类型：<strong>涉害深浅</strong>）。 原书注：传鬼为生格 · 庚午日第五局，火鬼生干上辰土、辰土育庚金</p></blockquote>\n<h3 id=\"贵德临身消除万祸格-灾祸皆消\">贵德临身消除万祸格：灾祸皆消</h3>\n<blockquote class=\"cite\"><p><q class=\"yw\">贵德临身消除万祸格，如乙丑、乙巳日并酉加巳为初传，三传金局并来伤其乙干，如用昼贵，凶不可遏，设用夜贵反为吉。言初传酉金上被腾蛇克，下被巳火伤，又被中传丑土来墓，末传巳火来克其酉金，全无力来克干。纵然干上乘申金，又为贵人、又为日之德神临身，能伏诸煞。</q> <span class=\"src\">〔大全三·第 11 法〕</span></p></blockquote>\n<p><strong>白话</strong>　贵人、德神临日干，消除万祸格。如乙丑日第九局、乙巳日第九局，酉加巳作初传，三传合化金局、金克日干乙木。用昼贵则凶不可挡，用夜贵则反凶为吉。初传酉金上乘腾蛇、克日干，中传丑土为墓神，末传巳火克酉金，都无力克干；干上乘申金，又为贵人、又为日之德神临身，能降伏诸煞。</p>\n<p><strong>盘</strong>　乙丑日第 9 局　月将 丑 加占时 酉　（重审）</p>\n<div class=\"panwrap\"><div class=\"pan\"><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">酉</span><span class=\"dp\">巳</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">戌</span><span class=\"dp\">午</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">亥</span><span class=\"dp\">未</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">子</span><span class=\"dp\">申</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">丑</span><span class=\"dp\">酉</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">寅</span><span class=\"dp\">戌</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">卯</span><span class=\"dp\">亥</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">辰</span><span class=\"dp\">子</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">巳</span><span class=\"dp\">丑</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">午</span><span class=\"dp\">寅</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">未</span><span class=\"dp\">卯</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">申</span><span class=\"dp\">辰</span></div><div class=\"panmid\"></div></div></div>\n<p><strong>四课</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sike\"><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第四课</span><span class=\"up w-jin\">酉</span><span class=\"dn w-huo\">巳</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第三课</span><span class=\"up w-huo\">巳</span><span class=\"dn w-tu\">丑</span><span class=\"nt\">日支</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第二课</span><span class=\"up w-shui\">子</span><span class=\"dn w-jin\">申</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第一课</span><span class=\"up w-jin\">申</span><span class=\"dn w-mu\">乙</span><span class=\"nt\">日干，寄辰</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>三传</strong>　<strong>酉 → 丑 → 巳</strong></p>\n<blockquote><p>原书注：贵德临身消除万祸格 · 乙丑日第九局夜占，干上申乘贵人德神</p></blockquote>\n<h3 id=\"天将为救神格-消灾免祸\">天将为救神格：消灾免祸</h3>\n<blockquote class=\"cite\"><p><q class=\"yw\">天将为救神格，如辛巳日午加辛为用，三传火局并来伤干，诚为凶也。如观天将，昼夜皆是贵、常、勾土神，而窃其火气生其日干，亦宜免祸。</q> <span class=\"src\">〔大全三·第 11 法〕</span></p></blockquote>\n<p><strong>白话</strong>　三传为鬼、干支上皆无解救神，如果天将能解救，也可减祸或免祸。如辛巳日第五局午加辛，三传午寅戌合成火局、为鬼克干，干支上神又无解救之神、主凶。但不论昼占夜占，天将均是贵人、勾陈、太常土将，可窃火之气而生辛干。若日干强旺其祸可免，日干休囚也可减其凶咎。此类若三传乘水将，也是救神。</p>\n<p><strong>盘</strong>　辛巳日第 5 局　月将 亥 加占时 卯　（元首）</p>\n<div class=\"panwrap\"><div class=\"pan\"><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">丑</span><span class=\"dp\">巳</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">寅</span><span class=\"dp\">午</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">卯</span><span class=\"dp\">未</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">辰</span><span class=\"dp\">申</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">巳</span><span class=\"dp\">酉</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">午</span><span class=\"dp\">戌</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">未</span><span class=\"dp\">亥</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">申</span><span class=\"dp\">子</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">酉</span><span class=\"dp\">丑</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">戌</span><span class=\"dp\">寅</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">亥</span><span class=\"dp\">卯</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">子</span><span class=\"dp\">辰</span></div><div class=\"panmid\"></div></div></div>\n<p><strong>四课</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sike\"><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第四课</span><span class=\"up w-jin\">酉</span><span class=\"dn w-tu\">丑</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第三课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">丑</span><span class=\"dn w-huo\">巳</span><span class=\"nt\">日支</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第二课</span><span class=\"up w-mu\">寅</span><span class=\"dn w-huo\">午</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第一课</span><span class=\"up w-huo\">午</span><span class=\"dn w-jin\">辛</span><span class=\"nt\">日干，寄戌</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>三传</strong>　<strong>午 → 寅 → 戌</strong></p>\n<blockquote><p>原书注：天将为救神格 · 辛巳日第五局，土将窃火气生辛干</p></blockquote>\n<h3 id=\"脱气为救格-脱气克将\">脱气为救格：脱气克将</h3>\n<blockquote class=\"cite\"><p><q class=\"yw\">脱气为救格，如壬子日未加卯为用，三传木局并来脱干。且此例既无日鬼，岂宜处于众鬼虽彰全不畏者之例，三传木局切不可作脱气言之。如用夜将，缘三传天将皆勾、常、贵人土神，并来伤壬干，反赖三传木局去其土将，岂不应斯格也。余五壬日干上卯，夜贵并如其说。壬戌、壬子、癸卯、癸亥，三传未卯亥夜同。</q> <span class=\"src\">〔大全三·第 11 法〕</span></p></blockquote>\n<p><strong>白话</strong>　脱气为救格，如壬子日第九局，未加卯为用，三传合成木局、木脱日干壬水，而课中无日鬼，不宜处于众鬼虽彰全不畏之例；但三传天将皆勾陈、太常、贵人土神、克壬水，三传木局克土将，故不应以脱气而论。其他五壬日第九局干上卯、夜贵，亦同此例。壬戌、壬子、癸卯日第五局、癸亥日第五局，三传未卯亥、夜贵，亦同此例。</p>\n<p><strong>盘</strong>　壬子日第 9 局　月将 卯 加占时 亥　（重审）</p>\n<div class=\"panwrap\"><div class=\"pan\"><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">酉</span><span class=\"dp\">巳</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">戌</span><span class=\"dp\">午</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">亥</span><span class=\"dp\">未</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">子</span><span class=\"dp\">申</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">丑</span><span class=\"dp\">酉</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">寅</span><span class=\"dp\">戌</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">卯</span><span class=\"dp\">亥</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">辰</span><span class=\"dp\">子</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">巳</span><span class=\"dp\">丑</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">午</span><span class=\"dp\">寅</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">未</span><span class=\"dp\">卯</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">申</span><span class=\"dp\">辰</span></div><div class=\"panmid\"></div></div></div>\n<p><strong>四课</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sike\"><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第四课</span><span class=\"up w-jin\">申</span><span class=\"dn w-tu\">辰</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第三课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">辰</span><span class=\"dn w-shui\">子</span><span class=\"nt\">日支</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第二课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">未</span><span class=\"dn w-mu\">卯</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第一课</span><span class=\"up w-mu\">卯</span><span class=\"dn w-shui\">壬</span><span class=\"nt\">日干，寄亥</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>三传</strong>　<strong>未 → 亥 → 卯</strong></p>\n<blockquote><p>原书注：脱气为救格 · 壬子日第九局夜占，三传木局克土将、非脱气</p></blockquote>\n<h3 id=\"旧版-App-的说法\">旧版 App 的说法</h3>\n<p><strong>旧版主题释义</strong>（鬼贼）：三传皆鬼但干上有救神或鬼空，终不为祸</p>\n<p><strong>定义</strong>　三传皆日鬼，但干上有救神（如寅木制土鬼）、或鬼坐空乡。</p>\n<p>⭐ 先值惊危、后无所畏；有人谋害终不能为祸。救神不可作脱气言。</p>\n<p><strong>毕法象义</strong><span class=\"src\">〔凶中取救〕</span>众鬼虽彰：课传多鬼，若鬼空、入墓、被制或日干旺相，鬼多也未必可畏。　<strong>用法</strong>：断凶要算实际作用力，不是数官鬼个数。</p>\n<hr>", "bf12": "<h2 id=\"第-12-法-虽忧狐假虎威仪-借力谋事\">第 12 法　虽忧狐假虎威仪：借力谋事</h2>\n<blockquote><p><strong>注</strong>　夫仗他人之力，乞儿向火何倚冰山之徒</p></blockquote>\n<h3 id=\"狐假虎威格-不宜动作\">狐假虎威格：不宜动作</h3>\n<blockquote class=\"cite\"><p><q class=\"yw\">狐假虎威格，如丁未日干上子，其丁火实畏子水所克，反倚赖支属土却能制其子水，不敢来伤丁干也。疑丁火喻狐，未土喻虎，故名为狐假虎威仪之例也。凡占切不可动谋，如动用离其未土，其子水随踪而伤丁火也。又辛亥日干上亥，昼虎夜元皆乘脱气，尤赖亥水坐于戌土之上，尚惧戌土，不至辛金全脱，尤不宜动作，稍如前例。余五辛日亦可如此说。</q> <span class=\"src\">〔大全三·第 12 法〕</span></p></blockquote>\n<p><strong>白话</strong>　要仗他处之力来摆脱困境，叫狐假虎威。凡占得此课，均主宜静不宜动，动则有灾祸。如丁未日第八局，干上神子，丁火畏子水所克，倚赖支未土制子水，才不敢来伤丁干。此处以丁火喻作狐、未土喻作虎，好像狐假借虎之威仪，要借他处之力方可守身。占得此课不可有所动作，动则离其未土、子水随之伤丁火。又如辛亥日第十二局，干上神亥，昼乘白虎、夜乘玄武皆为脱气，倚仗亥水坐于戌土之上、惧戌土，不至于使辛金全脱，但也不宜动作，与前例相近。其余五辛日亦同此说。</p>\n<p>*（原书此格无盘图。）*</p>\n<h3 id=\"旧版-App-的说法\">旧版 App 的说法</h3>\n<p><strong>旧版主题释义</strong>（鬼贼）：日干畏克但倚支神制克神，如狐借虎威</p>\n<p><strong>定义</strong>　日干畏克，倚赖支神制克神（如狐借虎威）。</p>\n<p>⭐ 切不可动谋，动则离支神保护、克神伤干。</p>\n<p><strong>毕法象义</strong><span class=\"src\">〔凶中取救〕</span>狐假虎威：凶神本身无气，借旺神凶将之势吓人，外强中干。　<strong>用法</strong>：查真正旺神是否生助凶神；借势者空破，多有惊无实。</p>\n<hr>", "bf13": "<h2 id=\"第-13-法-鬼贼当时无畏忌-时令与克贼\">第 13 法　鬼贼当时无畏忌：时令与克贼</h2>\n<blockquote><p><strong>注</strong>　吴释越而终为越灭吴</p></blockquote>\n<h3 id=\"鬼自贪荣格-不宜动作\">鬼自贪荣格：不宜动作</h3>\n<blockquote class=\"cite\"><p><q class=\"yw\">假令戊子日干上午，三传寅卯辰皆是日鬼。如春占木旺，诚所畏也，殊不知木至春令而荣旺，既贪荣盛而无意克土，故戊土不畏木克也。此例虽春占无畏，防至夏秋其祸仍发，如有祸时，便宜断绝，免致后患。其余传内全逢日鬼者，各详四季天令而言之。三合为鬼亦如前说。</q> <span class=\"src\">〔大全三·第 13 法〕</span></p></blockquote>\n<p><strong>白话</strong>　<q class=\"yw\">众鬼虽彰全不畏</q>说的是救神，这里说的则是时令。如果鬼乘旺、贪其荣盛便无相克之意。如戊子日第十二局，干上神午，三传寅卯辰皆为日鬼；但若春占则木旺，贪荣盛而无克土之意，故戊土不畏木克。但此课春占虽无畏，要提防至夏秋发生灾祸，如有灾祸便宜断绝、免致后患。其余传内逢日鬼的情况要根据四季具体情况而言。三合为鬼亦同前说。</p>\n<p>*（原书此格无盘图。）*</p>\n<h3 id=\"旧版-App-的说法\">旧版 App 的说法</h3>\n<p><strong>旧版主题释义</strong>（鬼贼）：三传鬼当令荣旺贪生，当时无畏、防休囚祸发</p>\n<p><strong>定义</strong>　三传皆日鬼，但鬼当令荣旺、贪生无意克干。</p>\n<p>⭐ 当时无畏，防至休囚之季祸发；如有祸宜断绝以免后患。</p>\n<p><strong>毕法象义</strong><span class=\"src\">〔凶中取救〕</span>鬼贼当时：官鬼当时旺动，但若日干同旺、有制有化，可将压力转为职权。　<strong>用法</strong>：求官以鬼为官，占病讼以鬼为害，必须随事转义。</p>\n<hr>", "bf14": "<h2 id=\"第-14-法-传财太旺反财亏-耗费资财\">第 14 法　传财太旺反财亏：耗费资财</h2>\n<blockquote><p><strong>注</strong>　汉黩武而海内空虚</p></blockquote>\n<h3 id=\"三传财太过格-不宜取财\">三传财太过格：不宜取财</h3>\n<blockquote class=\"cite\"><p><q class=\"yw\">假令戊申日干上丑，三传子申辰皆作日之财，兼昼夜天将皆是水中之兽，又于秋冬水生旺之月，占求财事即无财也。如取其财，切防反费己财，缘水自贪其生旺，不能与我作财，只待身旺之月，财气稍衰之月令，方可取其财。例尤多，余亦仿此。</q> <span class=\"src\">〔大全三·第 14 法〕</span></p></blockquote>\n<p><strong>白话</strong>　三传皆财，不是财贪生旺、不与我作财，便是财神太旺、日干羸弱，故不能胜财。若日干强旺，仍以有财断。例如戊申日第五局，干上神丑，三传子申辰三合水局为日财。另外昼夜天将腾蛇、青龙、玄武都是水中之兽，如果又在秋冬水生旺之月，求财则主无财。如若取财，应提防反而耗费自己的财物——水贪生旺、不能与我作财，只有等到身旺、财气稍衰的月令方可取财。此课体有很多课例。</p>\n<p><strong>盘</strong>　戊申日第 5 局　月将 亥 加占时 卯　（重审）</p>\n<div class=\"panwrap\"><div class=\"pan\"><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">丑</span><span class=\"dp\">巳</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">寅</span><span class=\"dp\">午</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">卯</span><span class=\"dp\">未</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">辰</span><span class=\"dp\">申</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">巳</span><span class=\"dp\">酉</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">午</span><span class=\"dp\">戌</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">未</span><span class=\"dp\">亥</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">申</span><span class=\"dp\">子</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">酉</span><span class=\"dp\">丑</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">戌</span><span class=\"dp\">寅</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">亥</span><span class=\"dp\">卯</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">子</span><span class=\"dp\">辰</span></div><div class=\"panmid\"></div></div></div>\n<p><strong>四课</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sike\"><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第四课</span><span class=\"up w-shui\">子</span><span class=\"dn w-tu\">辰</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第三课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">辰</span><span class=\"dn w-jin\">申</span><span class=\"nt\">日支</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第二课</span><span class=\"up w-jin\">酉</span><span class=\"dn w-tu\">丑</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第一课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">丑</span><span class=\"dn w-tu\">戊</span><span class=\"nt\">日干，寄巳</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>三传</strong>　<strong>子 → 申 → 辰</strong></p>\n<blockquote><p>原书注：三传财太过格 · 戊申日第五局，三传申子辰水局财太旺</p></blockquote>\n<h3 id=\"进退连茹为财格-如网江鱼\">进退连茹为财格：如网江鱼</h3>\n<blockquote class=\"cite\"><p><q class=\"yw\">进退连茹为财格，如网江鱼之谕求财，不宜坐财墓，亦忌财加鬼墓。</q> <span class=\"src\">〔大全三·第 14 法〕</span></p></blockquote>\n<p><strong>白话</strong>　三传进退连茹、为日财，好像网江中之鱼。如若求财，不宜坐财墓，忌财加鬼墓。</p>\n<p>*（原书此格无盘图。）*</p>\n<h3 id=\"财神空亡格-反费己财\">财神空亡格：反费己财</h3>\n<blockquote class=\"cite\"><p><q class=\"yw\">财神空亡格，求财反费己财。缘见在之财已空，求外来之财岂有得也。如辛亥日干上寅、支上卯，二财皆空。庚戌日同。</q> <span class=\"src\">〔大全三·第 14 法〕</span></p></blockquote>\n<p><strong>白话</strong>　财神空亡，求财则反费己财。这是因为已有之财已耗尽、外来之财不可得。例如辛亥日第九局，干上神寅、支上神卯，二财皆空。庚戌日例也是这样。</p>\n<p><strong>盘</strong>　辛亥日第 9 局　月将 亥 加占时 未　（比用）</p>\n<div class=\"panwrap\"><div class=\"pan\"><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">酉</span><span class=\"dp\">巳</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">戌</span><span class=\"dp\">午</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">亥</span><span class=\"dp\">未</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">子</span><span class=\"dp\">申</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">丑</span><span class=\"dp\">酉</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">寅</span><span class=\"dp\">戌</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">卯</span><span class=\"dp\">亥</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">辰</span><span class=\"dp\">子</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">巳</span><span class=\"dp\">丑</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">午</span><span class=\"dp\">寅</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">未</span><span class=\"dp\">卯</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">申</span><span class=\"dp\">辰</span></div><div class=\"panmid\"></div></div></div>\n<p><strong>四课</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sike\"><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第四课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">未</span><span class=\"dn w-mu\">卯</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第三课</span><span class=\"up w-mu\">卯</span><span class=\"dn w-shui\">亥</span><span class=\"nt\">日支</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第二课</span><span class=\"up w-huo\">午</span><span class=\"dn w-mu\">寅</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第一课</span><span class=\"up w-mu\">寅</span><span class=\"dn w-jin\">辛</span><span class=\"nt\">日干，寄戌</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>三传</strong>　<strong>未 → 亥 → 卯</strong></p>\n<blockquote><p>原书注：财神空亡格 · 辛亥日第九局，干上寅、支上卯二财皆空</p></blockquote>\n<h3 id=\"旧版-App-的说法\">旧版 App 的说法</h3>\n<p><strong>旧版主题释义</strong>（财运）：三传财旺自贪生，求财反费己财</p>\n<p><strong>定义</strong>　三传皆财且财旺（如秋冬水旺），财自贪生旺不为我用。</p>\n<p>⭐ 求财反费己财；待身旺财衰之月方可取。</p>\n<p><strong>毕法象义</strong><span class=\"src\">〔财物得失〕</span>传财太旺：三传财多财旺，日干衰弱无力承担，反为财所累。　<strong>用法</strong>：求财先看身财平衡；年命得比劫扶身方能任财。</p>\n<hr>", "bf15": "<h2 id=\"第-15-法-脱上逢脱防虚诈-虚耗不实\">第 15 法　脱上逢脱防虚诈：虚耗不实</h2>\n<blockquote><p><strong>注</strong>　金以议和愚宋，而宋以议和自愚</p></blockquote>\n<h3 id=\"脱上脱格-虚诈不实\">脱上脱格：虚诈不实</h3>\n<blockquote class=\"cite\"><p><q class=\"yw\">谓日干生其上神，上神又生天将者，故名脱上脱。凡占尽被脱耗，多虚诈不实之象也。假令六庚日干上子，夜将上乘青龙，此乃庚干生上神，子水又生青龙木将，那更三传皆是水局并来盗日，凡占岂不遭虚诈乎。内有庚子日子加庚，乃支上门来脱干，三传又来脱之，并三传天将昼夜俱是蛇龙元，尽被脱盗。倘熟视之，其庚居天盘坐辰土之上受生，子水居申金之上受长生，终不致脱尽，不可不知。六甲日干上巳，昼占上乘太常；六乙日干上午，昼占上乘天空；六丁日干上丑，昼占上乘太阴。</q> <span class=\"src\">〔大全三·第 15 法〕</span></p></blockquote>\n<p><strong>白话</strong>　日干生其上神、上神又生天将，称为脱上逢脱。占事得此，主尽被脱耗，多为虚诈不实之象。例如六庚日，干上神子，夜将上乘青龙，庚金生上神子水、子水又生青龙木将，便是脱上脱。再加上三传合水局、为日之盗气，占事更主虚诈不实。庚子日第九局，庚上神子，为支上门来脱干；三传合水局，又来脱干；而且三传天将昼夜均是螣蛇、青龙、玄武，属水，脱泄日干。但仔细辨识，会发现课中庚金天盘居于辰土之上受生、子水居申金之上受长生，终不致脱尽，不可不知。六甲日干上巳、昼占乘太常；六乙日干上午、昼占乘天空；六丁日干上丑、昼占乘太阴。</p>\n<p><strong>盘</strong>　庚子日第 9 局　月将 辰 加占时 子　（涉害·复等）</p>\n<div class=\"panwrap\"><div class=\"pan\"><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">酉</span><span class=\"dp\">巳</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">戌</span><span class=\"dp\">午</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">亥</span><span class=\"dp\">未</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">子</span><span class=\"dp\">申</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">丑</span><span class=\"dp\">酉</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">寅</span><span class=\"dp\">戌</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">卯</span><span class=\"dp\">亥</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">辰</span><span class=\"dp\">子</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">巳</span><span class=\"dp\">丑</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">午</span><span class=\"dp\">寅</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">未</span><span class=\"dp\">卯</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">申</span><span class=\"dp\">辰</span></div><div class=\"panmid\"></div></div></div>\n<p><strong>四课</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sike\"><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第四课</span><span class=\"up w-jin\">申</span><span class=\"dn w-tu\">辰</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第三课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">辰</span><span class=\"dn w-shui\">子</span><span class=\"nt\">日支</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第二课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">辰</span><span class=\"dn w-shui\">子</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第一课</span><span class=\"up w-shui\">子</span><span class=\"dn w-jin\">庚</span><span class=\"nt\">日干，寄申</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>三传</strong>　<strong>辰 → 申 → 子</strong></p>\n<blockquote><p>原书注：脱上脱格 · 庚子日第九局（夜占），干生上神、上神生将、三传水局盗日</p></blockquote>\n<h3 id=\"无依脱耗格-接连脱耗\">无依脱耗格：接连脱耗</h3>\n<blockquote class=\"cite\"><p><q class=\"yw\">无依脱耗格，惟丁未日返吟，昼占乃干生丑，丑生将，一火逢九土。如忧事不止一件，若止见一件，别项又来，必有大灾。</q> <span class=\"src\">〔大全三·第 15 法〕</span></p></blockquote>\n<p><strong>白话</strong>　丁未日第七局，返吟课，昼占，干生上神丑、丑生天将，课中除丁干属火外均属土，为一火逢九土（四课上逢四土、中末两土、三传三土将）。丁火日干无救扶，火生土，故称无依脱耗格。占事逢此，主耗费、虚诈之事并非只有一件，接踵而至，必有大灾。</p>\n<p><strong>盘</strong>　丁未日第 7 局　月将 亥 加占时 巳　（返吟·无亲·井栏射）</p>\n<div class=\"panwrap\"><div class=\"pan\"><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">亥</span><span class=\"dp\">巳</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">子</span><span class=\"dp\">午</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">丑</span><span class=\"dp\">未</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">寅</span><span class=\"dp\">申</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">卯</span><span class=\"dp\">酉</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">辰</span><span class=\"dp\">戌</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">巳</span><span class=\"dp\">亥</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">午</span><span class=\"dp\">子</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">未</span><span class=\"dp\">丑</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">申</span><span class=\"dp\">寅</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">酉</span><span class=\"dp\">卯</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">戌</span><span class=\"dp\">辰</span></div><div class=\"panmid\"></div></div></div>\n<p><strong>四课</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sike\"><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第四课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">未</span><span class=\"dn w-tu\">丑</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第三课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">丑</span><span class=\"dn w-tu\">未</span><span class=\"nt\">日支</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第二课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">未</span><span class=\"dn w-tu\">丑</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第一课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">丑</span><span class=\"dn w-huo\">丁</span><span class=\"nt\">日干，寄未</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>三传</strong>　<strong>巳 → 丑 → 丑</strong></p>\n<blockquote><p>原书注：无依脱耗格 · 丁未日第七局返吟（昼占），一火逢九土、无救扶</p></blockquote>\n<h3 id=\"脱盗格-尤其虚诈\">脱盗格：尤其虚诈</h3>\n<blockquote class=\"cite\"><p><q class=\"yw\">脱盗格，乃干上逢脱气，天将作元武者例，亦如前说。六辛日干上亥，夜占乘元武；六壬日干上寅，昼占乘元武；六癸日干上寅，昼占上乘元武。余有甲午日午加甲，三传又是火局，并支来盗干，虚诈尤甚。内辛亥日干上亥尤可恶，缘支干上皆脱，初墓又坐脱方，中末空亡，昼虎夜元之将日上俱值，其凶可见。</q> <span class=\"src\">〔大全三·第 15 法〕</span></p></blockquote>\n<p><strong>白话</strong>　干上逢脱气、天将作玄武，玄武为盗神，故称脱盗格。六辛日干上亥、夜占乘玄武；六壬日干上寅、昼占乘玄武；六癸日干上寅、昼占乘玄武，皆属此格。另有甲午日第九局，午加甲，三传合火局，支来盗干，尤主虚诈不实。辛亥日第十二局，干上亥更为可恶，因支干上皆脱气、初传墓神又坐脱方、中末空亡，昼乘白虎、夜乘玄武，其凶可见。</p>\n<p><strong>盘</strong>　甲午日第 9 局　月将 戌 加占时 午　（元首）</p>\n<div class=\"panwrap\"><div class=\"pan\"><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">酉</span><span class=\"dp\">巳</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">戌</span><span class=\"dp\">午</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">亥</span><span class=\"dp\">未</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">子</span><span class=\"dp\">申</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">丑</span><span class=\"dp\">酉</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">寅</span><span class=\"dp\">戌</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">卯</span><span class=\"dp\">亥</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">辰</span><span class=\"dp\">子</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">巳</span><span class=\"dp\">丑</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">午</span><span class=\"dp\">寅</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">未</span><span class=\"dp\">卯</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">申</span><span class=\"dp\">辰</span></div><div class=\"panmid\"></div></div></div>\n<p><strong>四课</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sike\"><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第四课</span><span class=\"up w-mu\">寅</span><span class=\"dn w-tu\">戌</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第三课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">戌</span><span class=\"dn w-huo\">午</span><span class=\"nt\">日支</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第二课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">戌</span><span class=\"dn w-huo\">午</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第一课</span><span class=\"up w-huo\">午</span><span class=\"dn w-mu\">甲</span><span class=\"nt\">日干，寄寅</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>三传</strong>　<strong>寅 → 午 → 戌</strong></p>\n<blockquote><p>原书注：脱盗格 · 甲午日第九局（昼占），午加甲、三传火局、支来盗干</p></blockquote>\n<h3 id=\"旧版-App-的说法\">旧版 App 的说法</h3>\n<p><strong>旧版主题释义</strong>（财运）：干生上、上生将，尽被脱耗、多虚诈</p>\n<p><strong>定义</strong>　日干生上神、上神又生天将（脱上脱）。</p>\n<p>⭐ 尽被脱耗、多虚诈不实；三传成局盗日尤甚。</p>\n<p><strong>毕法象义</strong><span class=\"src\">〔财物得失〕</span>脱上逢脱：日干连续生泄，脱气之上又见脱，主多重耗散、虚情诈取。　<strong>用法</strong>：占财防反复支出，占人防一层转一层的敗衍。</p>\n<hr>", "bf16": "<h2 id=\"第-16-法-空上乘空事莫追-全无实象\">第 16 法　空上乘空事莫追：全无实象</h2>\n<blockquote><p><strong>注</strong>　陈隋基业于唐，五代收功于宋</p></blockquote>\n<h3 id=\"空上天空格-无中生有\">空上天空格：无中生有</h3>\n<blockquote class=\"cite\"><p><q class=\"yw\">谓上见旬空乘天空者，凡占指空话空，全无实象。如甲申日干上未，昼占上乘天空。余占日上空亡，上乘天空，皆仿此。</q> <span class=\"src\">〔大全三·第 16 法〕</span></p></blockquote>\n<p><strong>白话</strong>　空亡为虚空之处，天空又是虚诈之神。占事如干上神或三传中逢旬空、天将又乘天空，叫空上逢空。主指空画空、全无实象，没有真实之象。占吉事不利，占忧事反佳。例如甲申日第八局，干上神未（旬空），昼占，上乘天空，属此例。</p>\n<p><strong>盘</strong>　甲申日第 8 局　月将 亥 加占时 午　（比用）</p>\n<div class=\"panwrap\"><div class=\"pan\"><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">戌</span><span class=\"dp\">巳</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">亥</span><span class=\"dp\">午</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">子</span><span class=\"dp\">未</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">丑</span><span class=\"dp\">申</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">寅</span><span class=\"dp\">酉</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">卯</span><span class=\"dp\">戌</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">辰</span><span class=\"dp\">亥</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">巳</span><span class=\"dp\">子</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">午</span><span class=\"dp\">丑</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">未</span><span class=\"dp\">寅</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">申</span><span class=\"dp\">卯</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">酉</span><span class=\"dp\">辰</span></div><div class=\"panmid\"></div></div></div>\n<p><strong>四课</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sike\"><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第四课</span><span class=\"up w-huo\">午</span><span class=\"dn w-tu\">丑</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第三课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">丑</span><span class=\"dn w-jin\">申</span><span class=\"nt\">日支</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第二课</span><span class=\"up w-shui\">子</span><span class=\"dn w-tu\">未</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第一课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">未</span><span class=\"dn w-mu\">甲</span><span class=\"nt\">日干，寄寅</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>三传</strong>　<strong>子 → 巳 → 戌</strong></p>\n<blockquote><p>原书注：空上天空格 · 甲申日第八局（昼占），干上未逢旬空又乘天空</p></blockquote>\n<h3 id=\"脱空格-无中生有\">脱空格：无中生有</h3>\n<blockquote class=\"cite\"><p><q class=\"yw\">脱空格，谓干上有脱乘天空，亦名脱空神，凡占皆无中生有，尽是脱空，全无实踪，不足取信也。如辛卯日干上子，昼占上乘天空，初传又是遥克，中末皆空亡，凡占尽被脱空。六辛日干上子，昼占乘天空；六乙日干上午，昼占乘空，余日皆仿此。但凡遥克为用作空亡，或坐空乡，或乘天空者，凡占皆虚无不实也。</q> <span class=\"src\">〔大全三·第 16 法〕</span></p></blockquote>\n<p><strong>白话</strong>　干上神为脱气、天将又乘天空，为脱空格。占得此格，主无中生有、尽皆脱耗、全无实象，不足取信。例如辛卯日第十一局，干上神子，昼占乘天空，初传遥克日干、中末传空亡，尽皆脱空，便属此格。六辛日干上子、昼占乘天空；六乙日干上午、昼占乘空，其余日以此类推。但凡遥克为用而作空亡、或坐空乡、或乘天空的格局，均主虚无不实。</p>\n<p><strong>盘</strong>　辛卯日第 11 局　月将 巳 加占时 卯　（遥克·蒿矢）</p>\n<div class=\"panwrap\"><div class=\"pan\"><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">未</span><span class=\"dp\">巳</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">申</span><span class=\"dp\">午</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">酉</span><span class=\"dp\">未</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">戌</span><span class=\"dp\">申</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">亥</span><span class=\"dp\">酉</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">子</span><span class=\"dp\">戌</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">丑</span><span class=\"dp\">亥</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">寅</span><span class=\"dp\">子</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">卯</span><span class=\"dp\">丑</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">辰</span><span class=\"dp\">寅</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">巳</span><span class=\"dp\">卯</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">午</span><span class=\"dp\">辰</span></div><div class=\"panmid\"></div></div></div>\n<p><strong>四课</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sike\"><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第四课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">未</span><span class=\"dn w-huo\">巳</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第三课</span><span class=\"up w-huo\">巳</span><span class=\"dn w-mu\">卯</span><span class=\"nt\">日支</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第二课</span><span class=\"up w-mu\">寅</span><span class=\"dn w-shui\">子</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第一课</span><span class=\"up w-shui\">子</span><span class=\"dn w-jin\">辛</span><span class=\"nt\">日干，寄戌</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>三传</strong>　<strong>巳 → 未 → 酉</strong></p>\n<blockquote><p>原书注：脱空格 · 辛卯日第十一局（昼占），干上子乘天空、初传遥克、中末空亡</p></blockquote>\n<h3 id=\"旧版-App-的说法\">旧版 App 的说法</h3>\n<p><strong>旧版主题释义</strong>（财运）：旬空又乘天空，指空话空、全无实象</p>\n<p><strong>定义</strong>　旬空之神又乘天空。</p>\n<p>⭐ 凡占指空话空、全无实象，欲成事不可得。</p>\n<p><strong>毕法象义</strong><span class=\"src\">〔空亡虚实〕</span>空上乘空：地支空亡又乘天空，为空象重叠，所问多无实据。　<strong>用法</strong>：求财求人不宜追逐；占凶事则可为凶象不实。</p>\n<hr>", "bf17": "<h2 id=\"第-17-法-进茹空亡宜退步-宜退不宜进\">第 17 法　进茹空亡宜退步：宜退不宜进</h2>\n<blockquote><p><strong>注</strong>　坎初六：“习坎，入于坎窞，凶。”遇此课宜班师</p></blockquote>\n<h3 id=\"进茹空亡格-宜抽身退步\">进茹空亡格：宜抽身退步</h3>\n<blockquote class=\"cite\"><p><q class=\"yw\">假令壬子日干上子，三传寅卯辰，皆是空亡。既向前值三空亡，即宜退步，抽身缩首，却就支干上子与丑合，反有所得，庶使壬水不被传木全脱，可以全身远害，不利托人。如甲午日干上卯，三传辰巳午亦皆是空亡，亦宜退步，庶乎甲木不被传火脱尽，奈支干前后夹定脱气在内，尽被脱空而无穷也，如遇丑为年命，始宜退步就其禄神。</q> <span class=\"src\">〔大全三·第 17 法〕</span></p></blockquote>\n<p><strong>白话</strong>　传进茹指三传连续而进，如亥子丑、寅卯辰等。占事逢此，本是宜向前的课；但若逢空亡，向前则空空如也，反而宜于缩首、抽身退步，反有所得。例如壬子日第十二局，壬上神子、支上神丑，三传寅卯辰——壬子属甲辰旬，寅卯旬空、辰土落空，三传无一实处，只宜守旧，诸占皆凶，不宜妄动。再如甲午日第十二局，干上神卯，三传辰巳午也都是空亡，宜于退步；就算甲木不被传火脱尽，但干支前后夹定脱气，因而尽被脱空。若遇丑年为年命，适宜保守退步就禄神。</p>\n<p><strong>盘</strong>　壬子日第 12 局　月将 未 加占时 午　（知一）</p>\n<div class=\"panwrap\"><div class=\"pan\"><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">午</span><span class=\"dp\">巳</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">未</span><span class=\"dp\">午</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">申</span><span class=\"dp\">未</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">酉</span><span class=\"dp\">申</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">戌</span><span class=\"dp\">酉</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">亥</span><span class=\"dp\">戌</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">子</span><span class=\"dp\">亥</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">丑</span><span class=\"dp\">子</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">寅</span><span class=\"dp\">丑</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">卯</span><span class=\"dp\">寅</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">辰</span><span class=\"dp\">卯</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">巳</span><span class=\"dp\">辰</span></div><div class=\"panmid\"></div></div></div>\n<p><strong>四课</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sike\"><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第四课</span><span class=\"up w-mu\">寅</span><span class=\"dn w-tu\">丑</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第三课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">丑</span><span class=\"dn w-shui\">子</span><span class=\"nt\">日支</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第二课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">丑</span><span class=\"dn w-shui\">子</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第一课</span><span class=\"up w-shui\">子</span><span class=\"dn w-shui\">壬</span><span class=\"nt\">日干，寄亥</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>三传</strong>　<strong>寅 → 卯 → 辰</strong></p>\n<blockquote><p>原书注：进茹空亡格 · 壬子日第十二局（昼占），三传寅卯辰皆空亡</p></blockquote>\n<h3 id=\"脱空格-苦不堪言\">脱空格：苦不堪言</h3>\n<blockquote class=\"cite\"><p><q class=\"yw\">脱空格，如癸丑日干上寅，自是空亡，那更寅卯辰为三传，使癸水生其脱空，虽有千金亦不周其足。如昼占乘元武在干上尤甚，占讼费而不直，占病脱而虚甚，终不能退步。</q> <span class=\"src\">〔大全三·第 17 法〕</span></p></blockquote>\n<p><strong>白话</strong>　三传连茹空亡，又临干上脱干，再乘凶将，终被脱尽，苦不堪言。如癸丑日第十二局，干上寅本是空亡，三传寅卯辰，寅卯旬空、辰土坐空。寅木脱气又临癸干、上乘玄武盗神。占讼耗费许多而讼不能伸，占病虚脱，终不能免灾。</p>\n<p><strong>盘</strong>　癸丑日第 12 局　月将 未 加占时 午　（八专）</p>\n<div class=\"panwrap\"><div class=\"pan\"><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">午</span><span class=\"dp\">巳</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">未</span><span class=\"dp\">午</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">申</span><span class=\"dp\">未</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">酉</span><span class=\"dp\">申</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">戌</span><span class=\"dp\">酉</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">亥</span><span class=\"dp\">戌</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">子</span><span class=\"dp\">亥</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">丑</span><span class=\"dp\">子</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">寅</span><span class=\"dp\">丑</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">卯</span><span class=\"dp\">寅</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">辰</span><span class=\"dp\">卯</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">巳</span><span class=\"dp\">辰</span></div><div class=\"panmid\"></div></div></div>\n<p><strong>四课</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sike\"><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第四课</span><span class=\"up w-mu\">卯</span><span class=\"dn w-mu\">寅</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第三课</span><span class=\"up w-mu\">寅</span><span class=\"dn w-tu\">丑</span><span class=\"nt\">日支</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第二课</span><span class=\"up w-mu\">卯</span><span class=\"dn w-mu\">寅</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第一课</span><span class=\"up w-mu\">寅</span><span class=\"dn w-shui\">癸</span><span class=\"nt\">日干，寄丑</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>三传</strong>　<strong>寅 → 卯 → 辰</strong></p>\n<blockquote><p>原书注：脱空格 · 癸丑日第十二局（昼占），干上寅空乘玄武、三传寅卯辰脱空</p></blockquote>\n<h3 id=\"旧版-App-的说法\">旧版 App 的说法</h3>\n<p><strong>旧版主题释义</strong>（财运）：向前三传皆空，宜退步抽身缩首</p>\n<p><strong>定义</strong>　向前三传（连茹）皆值空亡。</p>\n<p>⭐ 宜退步抽身缩首，就干支上有合处反有所得；不利托人。</p>\n<p><strong>毕法象义</strong><span class=\"src\">〔进退动静〕</span>进茹空亡：三传进而前方逢空，越进越无着落。　<strong>用法</strong>：不宜强行扩张；退守处有德合生旺则宜退。</p>\n<hr>", "bf18": "<h2 id=\"第-18-法-踏脚空亡进用宜-宜进不宜退\">第 18 法　踏脚空亡进用宜：宜进不宜退</h2>\n<blockquote><p><strong>注</strong>　四课三传俱退连茹，丁巳日干上午，三传卯寅丑，宜深入重地</p></blockquote>\n<h3 id=\"退茹空亡格-宜向前迈进\">退茹空亡格：宜向前迈进</h3>\n<blockquote class=\"cite\"><p><q class=\"yw\">谓退步传全值空亡者，故名踏脚空亡，既退后遇空，宜进而不宜退也。如戊申日干上辰，三传卯寅丑皆作日之鬼，幸遇空，足可以脱灾避难。惟不宜守旧，缘干上乘墓，反宜于三传之外，向前一步，便逢禄神，此却不利有官人占之，缘官爻空亡故也。</q> <span class=\"src\">〔大全三·第 18 法〕</span></p></blockquote>\n<p><strong>白话</strong>　三传退连珠，全值空亡或落空。占事逢退茹，本宜退步，然退后逢空，如落陷阱，故称脚踏空亡。退后逢空，无法安身立命，需致之死地而向前迈进，故宜向前。例如戊申日第二局，干上辰土，三传卯寅丑皆作日鬼，幸遇空亡，故能脱灾避难。不宜守旧，因干上乘墓，反宜于三传之外再行前进一步，便是巳火德神，必有所得。然寅卯官鬼为求功名类神，所以不利求官。</p>\n<p><strong>盘</strong>　戊申日第 2 局　月将 巳 加占时 午　（元首）</p>\n<div class=\"panwrap\"><div class=\"pan\"><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">辰</span><span class=\"dp\">巳</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">巳</span><span class=\"dp\">午</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">午</span><span class=\"dp\">未</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">未</span><span class=\"dp\">申</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">申</span><span class=\"dp\">酉</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">酉</span><span class=\"dp\">戌</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">戌</span><span class=\"dp\">亥</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">亥</span><span class=\"dp\">子</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">子</span><span class=\"dp\">丑</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">丑</span><span class=\"dp\">寅</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">寅</span><span class=\"dp\">卯</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">卯</span><span class=\"dp\">辰</span></div><div class=\"panmid\"></div></div></div>\n<p><strong>四课</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sike\"><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第四课</span><span class=\"up w-huo\">午</span><span class=\"dn w-tu\">未</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第三课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">未</span><span class=\"dn w-jin\">申</span><span class=\"nt\">日支</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第二课</span><span class=\"up w-mu\">卯</span><span class=\"dn w-tu\">辰</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第一课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">辰</span><span class=\"dn w-tu\">戊</span><span class=\"nt\">日干，寄巳</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>三传</strong>　<strong>卯 → 寅 → 丑</strong></p>\n<blockquote><p>原书注：退茹空亡格 · 戊申日第二局（昼占），三传卯寅丑退连茹皆空、干上辰乘墓</p></blockquote>\n<h3 id=\"寻死格-占病尤凶\">寻死格：占病尤凶</h3>\n<blockquote class=\"cite\"><p><q class=\"yw\">寻死格，如丙午日干上辰，三传卯寅丑，虽三传生日，岂宜皆空，如占病，乃寻死格也。占父母病死尤急，如占子息病无畏，占讼理亏，必官人不主张，缘生我者空亡故也。如乙卯日干上卯，亦若寻死格。已上例如背后有三阴坑，岂宜退乎，如退则脚下踏空，反陷其身，凡占宜催督。</q> <span class=\"src\">〔大全三·第 18 法〕</span></p></blockquote>\n<p><strong>白话</strong>　三传为生我之神、逢空，占病得之为寻死格，占父母之病尤其如此，因此格中父母之神逢空亡的缘故。占子孙病则不妨，因父母之神克子孙、父母逢空则子孙无克制，反喜。例如丙午日第二局，干上神辰，三传卯寅丑，三传生日却皆是空亡，如占病则为寻死格。占父母病主凶，占子病则无畏；占讼主理亏、不得官家支持，因生我者空亡。再如乙卯日第二局，干上神卯，亦如寻死格。此例如同背后有三个阴坑，无法退后，退则脚下踏空、反陷其身，凡占宜催督。</p>\n<p><strong>盘</strong>　丙午日第 2 局　月将 巳 加占时 午　（元首）</p>\n<div class=\"panwrap\"><div class=\"pan\"><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">辰</span><span class=\"dp\">巳</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">巳</span><span class=\"dp\">午</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">午</span><span class=\"dp\">未</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">未</span><span class=\"dp\">申</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">申</span><span class=\"dp\">酉</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">酉</span><span class=\"dp\">戌</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">戌</span><span class=\"dp\">亥</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">亥</span><span class=\"dp\">子</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">子</span><span class=\"dp\">丑</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">丑</span><span class=\"dp\">寅</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">寅</span><span class=\"dp\">卯</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">卯</span><span class=\"dp\">辰</span></div><div class=\"panmid\"></div></div></div>\n<p><strong>四课</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sike\"><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第四课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">辰</span><span class=\"dn w-huo\">巳</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第三课</span><span class=\"up w-huo\">巳</span><span class=\"dn w-huo\">午</span><span class=\"nt\">日支</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第二课</span><span class=\"up w-mu\">卯</span><span class=\"dn w-tu\">辰</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第一课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">辰</span><span class=\"dn w-huo\">丙</span><span class=\"nt\">日干，寄巳</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>三传</strong>　<strong>卯 → 寅 → 丑</strong></p>\n<blockquote><p>原书注：寻死格 · 丙午日第二局（昼占），三传卯寅丑生日却皆空、占病凶</p></blockquote>\n<h3 id=\"踏脚空亡格-不宜妄动\">踏脚空亡格：不宜妄动</h3>\n<blockquote class=\"cite\"><p><q class=\"yw\">踏脚空亡格，惟不宜进前者例，但占事虚声而无成就耳。如甲子日戌加子为初传，乃是本旬之空，申加戌为中传，乃后旬之空，午加申为末传，乃外后旬之空亡，故向后全无实意，尽无成就。甲申日午加申，乙卯日丑加卯，丙辰日丑加卯，丁巳日丑加卯。</q> <span class=\"src\">〔大全三·第 18 法〕</span></p></blockquote>\n<p><strong>白话</strong>　初传为本旬空亡、中传为下旬空亡、末传又为下下一旬空亡，为踏脚空亡格。即使向前也是旬空，故宜守旧、不宜妄动。例如甲子日第三局，戌加子为初传、是本旬之空；申加戌为中传、为后旬之空；午加申为末传、为后后旬空亡，向前全无实意、全无成就。再如甲申日第三局午加申、乙卯日第三局丑加卯、丙辰日第三局丑加卯、丁巳日第三局丑加卯，也是如此。</p>\n<p><strong>盘</strong>　甲子日第 3 局　月将 辰 加占时 午　（涉害·复等）</p>\n<div class=\"panwrap\"><div class=\"pan\"><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">卯</span><span class=\"dp\">巳</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">辰</span><span class=\"dp\">午</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">巳</span><span class=\"dp\">未</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">午</span><span class=\"dp\">申</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">未</span><span class=\"dp\">酉</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">申</span><span class=\"dp\">戌</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">酉</span><span class=\"dp\">亥</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">戌</span><span class=\"dp\">子</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">亥</span><span class=\"dp\">丑</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">子</span><span class=\"dp\">寅</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">丑</span><span class=\"dp\">卯</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">寅</span><span class=\"dp\">辰</span></div><div class=\"panmid\"></div></div></div>\n<p><strong>四课</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sike\"><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第四课</span><span class=\"up w-jin\">申</span><span class=\"dn w-tu\">戌</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第三课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">戌</span><span class=\"dn w-shui\">子</span><span class=\"nt\">日支</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第二课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">戌</span><span class=\"dn w-shui\">子</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第一课</span><span class=\"up w-shui\">子</span><span class=\"dn w-mu\">甲</span><span class=\"nt\">日干，寄寅</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>三传</strong>　<strong>戌 → 申 → 午</strong></p>\n<blockquote><p>原书注：踏脚空亡格 · 甲子日第三局（昼占），初戌本旬空、中申后旬空、末午外旬空</p></blockquote>\n<h3 id=\"旧版-App-的说法\">旧版 App 的说法</h3>\n<p><strong>旧版主题释义</strong>（财运）：退步之传值空，既退遇空、宜进不宜退</p>\n<p><strong>定义</strong>　退步之传全值空亡（既退后而遇空）。</p>\n<p>⭐ 宜进而不宜退；鬼空可脱灾避难，惟不宜守旧（干上乘墓）。</p>\n<hr>", "bf19": "<h2 id=\"第-19-法-胎财生气妻怀孕-占孕之法\">第 19 法　胎财生气妻怀孕：占孕之法</h2>\n<h3 id=\"胎财生气格-占孕必成\">胎财生气格：占孕必成</h3>\n<blockquote class=\"cite\"><p><q class=\"yw\">谓日干之胎神，作日之妻财，又逢月内之生气者，如占妻必孕也。如壬寅日干上午，七月占，午加亥为发用，壬水胎在午，又是日之妻财，及七月生气在午，占妻必有孕而无疑。五壬日干上午，七月占皆同。六庚六辛日干上卯，四月占皆然。六戊六己日干上子，正月占亦主孕喜，何故言？戊己土神胎亦在子，或有用午为胎神者，不可不知，未免略具，拟土神歌于后。歌云“戊己当绝在亥怀，明知子上是胞胎”云云。支之胎神作月内生气，占妻有胎孕亦确，不必作干之财，惟此胎神临妻之年命尤好，或临支上亦同。妻财作生气，纵不作胎神亦可用。</q> <span class=\"src\">〔大全三·第 19 法〕</span></p></blockquote>\n<p><strong>白话</strong>　日干的胎神作日之妻财、又逢月内生气，占妻孕必成。例如壬寅日第六局，干上神午，七月占，午加亥发用，壬水胎在午、午又是壬之妻财、七月生气又在午，占妻必有孕。其他五壬日，干上神午、七月占，占断皆同此例。六庚、六辛日干上卯、四月占；六戊、六己日干上子、正月占，均主有孕。戊己土之胎神有多种说法（在子或在午），附土神歌云“戊己当绝在亥怀，明知子上是胞胎”。支之胎神作月内生气，占妻有胎孕亦确，不必作干财；惟胎神临妻之年命尤好，或临支上亦同。妻财若作生气，即使不作胎神亦断有孕。【生气煞】正月子、二月丑…一月一位顺行。【五行胎神】木胎酉、火胎子、土胎子、金胎卯、水胎午（按五行十二宫取胎）。</p>\n<p><strong>盘</strong>　壬寅日第 6 局　月将 巳 加占时 戌　（重审）</p>\n<div class=\"panwrap\"><div class=\"pan\"><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">子</span><span class=\"dp\">巳</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">丑</span><span class=\"dp\">午</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">寅</span><span class=\"dp\">未</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">卯</span><span class=\"dp\">申</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">辰</span><span class=\"dp\">酉</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">巳</span><span class=\"dp\">戌</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">午</span><span class=\"dp\">亥</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">未</span><span class=\"dp\">子</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">申</span><span class=\"dp\">丑</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">酉</span><span class=\"dp\">寅</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">戌</span><span class=\"dp\">卯</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">亥</span><span class=\"dp\">辰</span></div><div class=\"panmid\"></div></div></div>\n<p><strong>四课</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sike\"><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第四课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">辰</span><span class=\"dn w-jin\">酉</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第三课</span><span class=\"up w-jin\">酉</span><span class=\"dn w-mu\">寅</span><span class=\"nt\">日支</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第二课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">丑</span><span class=\"dn w-huo\">午</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第一课</span><span class=\"up w-huo\">午</span><span class=\"dn w-shui\">壬</span><span class=\"nt\">日干，寄亥</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>三传</strong>　<strong>午 → 丑 → 申</strong></p>\n<blockquote><p>原书注：胎财生气格 · 壬寅日第六局（七月占），午为壬胎兼妻财又值七月生气</p></blockquote>\n<h3 id=\"损胎格-胎孕有损\">损胎格：胎孕有损</h3>\n<blockquote class=\"cite\"><p><q class=\"yw\">损胎格，如壬辰日干上午为发用。又七月占，虽妻财作胎神乘生气，必后有损孕，缘午作空亡故也。余仿此。</q> <span class=\"src\">〔大全三·第 19 法〕</span></p></blockquote>\n<p><strong>白话</strong>　损胎格，如壬辰日第六局，干上神午发用，七月占，虽然妻财作胎神、乘生气，但午作空亡，故主胎孕有损。其余以此类推。</p>\n<p><strong>盘</strong>　壬辰日第 6 局　月将 巳 加占时 戌　（涉害·复等）</p>\n<div class=\"panwrap\"><div class=\"pan\"><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">子</span><span class=\"dp\">巳</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">丑</span><span class=\"dp\">午</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">寅</span><span class=\"dp\">未</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">卯</span><span class=\"dp\">申</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">辰</span><span class=\"dp\">酉</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">巳</span><span class=\"dp\">戌</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">午</span><span class=\"dp\">亥</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">未</span><span class=\"dp\">子</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">申</span><span class=\"dp\">丑</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">酉</span><span class=\"dp\">寅</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">戌</span><span class=\"dp\">卯</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">亥</span><span class=\"dp\">辰</span></div><div class=\"panmid\"></div></div></div>\n<p><strong>四课</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sike\"><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第四课</span><span class=\"up w-huo\">午</span><span class=\"dn w-shui\">亥</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第三课</span><span class=\"up w-shui\">亥</span><span class=\"dn w-tu\">辰</span><span class=\"nt\">日支</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第二课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">丑</span><span class=\"dn w-huo\">午</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第一课</span><span class=\"up w-huo\">午</span><span class=\"dn w-shui\">壬</span><span class=\"nt\">日干，寄亥</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>三传</strong>　<strong>午 → 丑 → 申</strong></p>\n<blockquote><p>原书注：损胎格 · 壬辰日第六局（七月占），午作胎神乘生气却逢旬空</p></blockquote>\n<h3 id=\"妾孕格-妻妾有孕\">妾孕格：妻妾有孕</h3>\n<blockquote class=\"cite\"><p><q class=\"yw\">妾孕格，如辛癸己日，胎神为生气，乃妻妾之妹有孕尤验。如丙丁日胎神在子，如正月占非妻有孕，即是偏房也。</q> <span class=\"src\">〔大全三·第 19 法〕</span></p></blockquote>\n<p><strong>白话</strong>　日干之胎神不作妻财、但为月内生气，便不是妻子怀孕，而是妾或情妇等有孕。如辛、癸、己日，胎神为生气，主妻妾之妹有孕。如丙、丁日胎神在子、正月占，不是妻有孕，就是偏房有孕。</p>\n<p>*（原书此格无盘图。）*</p>\n<h3 id=\"私孕格-婢妾有孕\">私孕格：婢妾有孕</h3>\n<blockquote class=\"cite\"><p><q class=\"yw\">私孕格，如辛癸日乘元有私。外有甲乙日胎神在酉，十月占；丙丁日胎神在子，正月占，非妻有孕，必是偏室婢妾有胎孕也。如作空乘死气，必是鬼胎也。</q> <span class=\"src\">〔大全三·第 19 法〕</span></p></blockquote>\n<p><strong>白话</strong>　私孕格，如辛、癸日，胎神乘玄武，玄武为阴私之神，故主有私孕。另外，甲、乙日胎神在酉、十月占；丙、丁日胎神在子、正月占，不是妻子有孕，必是偏室、婢妾有胎孕。如果作空亡、乘死气，必是鬼胎。</p>\n<p>*（原书此格无盘图。）*</p>\n<h3 id=\"互胎格-妻必有孕\">互胎格：妻必有孕</h3>\n<blockquote class=\"cite\"><p><q class=\"yw\">互胎格，如戊寅日干上酉，乃支之胎神，支上午乃干之胎神，又作夫妻之行年本命，必然妻怀孕喜，不必寻生气及财神也。乙丑、己未、癸未，干上子；己未、癸丑、己丑、辛未、丁丑，干上午；甲申干上卯，庚寅干上酉，已上并是干上得支之胎神，支上得干之胎神也。</q> <span class=\"src\">〔大全三·第 19 法〕</span></p></blockquote>\n<p><strong>白话</strong>　互胎格，如戊寅日第九局，干上神酉为支之胎神、支上神午为干之胎神，便属此例。如果夫妻的行年、本命上互乘胎神，即使没有见财神、生气，也必主妻子有孕。如乙丑、己未、癸未日干上子；己未、癸丑、己丑、辛未、丁丑日干上午；甲申日干上卯；庚寅日干上酉。以上都是干上得支之胎神、支上得干之胎神，为互胎格。</p>\n<p><strong>盘</strong>　戊寅日第 9 局　月将 戌 加占时 午　（昴星·虎视转蓬）</p>\n<div class=\"panwrap\"><div class=\"pan\"><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">酉</span><span class=\"dp\">巳</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">戌</span><span class=\"dp\">午</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">亥</span><span class=\"dp\">未</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">子</span><span class=\"dp\">申</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">丑</span><span class=\"dp\">酉</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">寅</span><span class=\"dp\">戌</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">卯</span><span class=\"dp\">亥</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">辰</span><span class=\"dp\">子</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">巳</span><span class=\"dp\">丑</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">午</span><span class=\"dp\">寅</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">未</span><span class=\"dp\">卯</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">申</span><span class=\"dp\">辰</span></div><div class=\"panmid\"></div></div></div>\n<p><strong>四课</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sike\"><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第四课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">戌</span><span class=\"dn w-huo\">午</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第三课</span><span class=\"up w-huo\">午</span><span class=\"dn w-mu\">寅</span><span class=\"nt\">日支</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第二课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">丑</span><span class=\"dn w-jin\">酉</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第一课</span><span class=\"up w-jin\">酉</span><span class=\"dn w-tu\">戊</span><span class=\"nt\">日干，寄巳</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>三传</strong>　<strong>丑 → 午 → 酉</strong></p>\n<blockquote><p>原书注：互胎格 · 戊寅日第九局，干上酉为支胎、支上午为干胎（昴星课）</p></blockquote>\n<h3 id=\"忧子格-产时子凶\">忧子格：产时子凶</h3>\n<blockquote class=\"cite\"><p><q class=\"yw\">忧子格，论孕产，乃六合三月占加申、四月占加酉，乃月之死气克六合，至产则忧子凶，此二例乃天后、六合为子母之类也。</q> <span class=\"src\">〔大全三·第 19 法〕</span></p></blockquote>\n<p><strong>白话</strong>　忧子格，占孕产，六合为子、天后为母。如果三月占六合加申、四月占六合加酉，为月之死气克六合，临产时，主子凶。</p>\n<p>*（原书此格无盘图。）*</p>\n<h3 id=\"忧母格-产时母凶\">忧母格：产时母凶</h3>\n<blockquote class=\"cite\"><p><q class=\"yw\">忧母格，如十一月占天后乘辰，五月占天后乘戌，八月占天后乘丑，二月占天后乘未，已上者乃月内死气克天后也，如至产期必忧母凶。</q> <span class=\"src\">〔大全三·第 19 法〕</span></p></blockquote>\n<p><strong>白话</strong>　忧母格理同忧子格。天后为母，如十一月占天后乘辰、五月占天后乘戌、八月占天后乘丑、二月占天后乘未，均为月内死气克天后，如至产期，主母凶。</p>\n<p>*（原书此格无盘图。）*</p>\n<h3 id=\"子恋母腹格-胎儿平安\">子恋母腹格：胎儿平安</h3>\n<blockquote class=\"cite\"><p><q class=\"yw\">子恋母腹格，如干加支、支加干而互相生者，乃名子恋母腹，利占孕则保育，不利占产，如至产期占之，迟生则吉。外有支加干而克干者，主产速，或无克亦产，支为母俯首已见其子也。</q> <span class=\"src\">〔大全三·第 19 法〕</span></p></blockquote>\n<p><strong>白话</strong>　干为子、支为母，干加支、支加干、互相相生，是母子有情。若占胎，主胎儿平安；若占产期，因母子相生却主产迟、不利占产，故称子恋母腹格。如果子孙类神临支或支下，名俯首见子，主产速。</p>\n<p>*（原书此格无盘图。）*</p>\n<h3 id=\"损孕格-占孕必损\">损孕格：占孕必损</h3>\n<blockquote class=\"cite\"><p><q class=\"yw\">损孕格，如壬辰日午加亥，癸巳日午加丑，庚戌日卯加申，辛亥日卯加戌，戊午日子加巳，己未日子加未，甲戌、乙亥日酉加巳午，丙辰、丁巳日子加辰戌丑未。已上例缘胎神作空受克，占产当日便生，占孕必损。</q> <span class=\"src\">〔大全三·第 19 法〕</span></p></blockquote>\n<p><strong>白话</strong>　胎神空亡是无胎。若占产，生子而无胎；若占孕，胎损而无胎。如壬辰日午加亥、癸巳日午加丑、庚戌日卯加申、辛亥日卯加戌、戊午日子加巳、己未日子加未、甲戌乙亥日酉加巳午、丙辰丁巳日子加辰戌丑未，以上均为损孕格。因胎神空亡，占产当日便生，占孕有凶。</p>\n<p><strong>盘</strong>　癸巳日第 8 局　月将 亥 加占时 午　（重审）</p>\n<div class=\"panwrap\"><div class=\"pan\"><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">戌</span><span class=\"dp\">巳</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">亥</span><span class=\"dp\">午</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">子</span><span class=\"dp\">未</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">丑</span><span class=\"dp\">申</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">寅</span><span class=\"dp\">酉</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">卯</span><span class=\"dp\">戌</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">辰</span><span class=\"dp\">亥</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">巳</span><span class=\"dp\">子</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">午</span><span class=\"dp\">丑</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">未</span><span class=\"dp\">寅</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">申</span><span class=\"dp\">卯</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">酉</span><span class=\"dp\">辰</span></div><div class=\"panmid\"></div></div></div>\n<p><strong>四课</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sike\"><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第四课</span><span class=\"up w-mu\">卯</span><span class=\"dn w-tu\">戌</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第三课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">戌</span><span class=\"dn w-huo\">巳</span><span class=\"nt\">日支</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第二课</span><span class=\"up w-shui\">亥</span><span class=\"dn w-huo\">午</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第一课</span><span class=\"up w-huo\">午</span><span class=\"dn w-shui\">癸</span><span class=\"nt\">日干，寄丑</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>三传</strong>　<strong>午 → 亥 → 辰</strong></p>\n<blockquote><p>原书注：损孕格 · 癸巳日第八局，胎神午作空受克、占孕必损</p></blockquote>\n<h3 id=\"月厌煞-凶或速生\">月厌煞：凶或速生</h3>\n<blockquote class=\"cite\"><p><q class=\"yw\">月厌煞，如三月占，不宜申加母年命上；九月占，不宜寅加母年命上。缘死气作月厌，占产必凶。六月占，巳加母年命；十二月占，亥加母年命上。缘生气作月厌，占产必速生。</q> <span class=\"src\">〔大全三·第 19 法〕</span></p></blockquote>\n<p><strong>白话</strong>　月厌煞，如三月占不宜申加母年命上、九月占不宜寅加母年命上，这是因为死气作月厌，占产必凶。六月占巳加母年命、十二月占亥加母年命上，这是生气作月厌，占产必速生。</p>\n<p>*（原书此格无盘图。）*</p>\n<h3 id=\"养神二血法-产速孕损\">养神二血法：产速孕损</h3>\n<blockquote class=\"cite\"><p><q class=\"yw\">养神二血法，如丙丁、戊己日，胎神在子，养神在丑。如在正月占，言血支血忌皆在丑，并养神而克胎神，如占产生速，如或占孕有损无疑。如在十二月占，言血支血忌皆在子作胎神，如占产亦生速，如占孕亦防损。已上血忌作空亡或坐空乡，占孕占产亦无妨也。</q> <span class=\"src\">〔大全三·第 19 法〕</span></p></blockquote>\n<p><strong>白话</strong>　血支、血忌值养神克胎，主有血光之灾。占产速、占孕损，因胎神受克之故。若血支、血忌值空亡或坐空，主占产、占孕皆无妨。养神二血法，如丙、丁日胎神在子、养神在丑，正月占血支、血忌皆在丑，养神克胎，便属此例；如丙辰、丁巳日占，丑土旬空，则主孕、产皆无妨。【血支】正月丑、二月寅、三月卯…顺行。【血忌】正月丑、二月未、三月寅、四月申…</p>\n<p>*（原书此格无盘图。）*</p>\n<h3 id=\"三元胎格-生-病-衰元胎\">三元胎格：生／病／衰元胎</h3>\n<blockquote class=\"cite\"><p><q class=\"yw\">三元胎格，如寅加亥为生元胎，怀孕之时渐有生意，生下男女，必兴旺家门也。如寅加巳为病元胎，如值此怀孕之时，母常有病，生下男女多病不甚长进。寅加辰为衰元胎卦，惟乙未日亥加丑昴星一课是也，怀孕之时，家道日渐衰替，生下男女身躯衰弱，全无生意。</q> <span class=\"src\">〔大全三·第 19 法〕</span></p></blockquote>\n<p><strong>白话</strong>　三元胎格即生元胎、病元胎、衰元胎。寅加亥为生元胎，怀孕之时渐觉生意，生下男女必兴旺家门；寅加巳为病元胎，怀孕之时母亲多有疾病，生下男女亦多病、不甚长进；寅加辰为衰元胎，只有乙未日、亥加丑这一课属此例（昴星课），怀孕之时家道日渐衰替，生下男女身躯衰弱、全无生气。</p>\n<p><strong>盘</strong>　乙未日第 3 局　月将 辰 加占时 午　（昴星·冬蛇掩目）</p>\n<div class=\"panwrap\"><div class=\"pan\"><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">卯</span><span class=\"dp\">巳</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">辰</span><span class=\"dp\">午</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">巳</span><span class=\"dp\">未</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">午</span><span class=\"dp\">申</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">未</span><span class=\"dp\">酉</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">申</span><span class=\"dp\">戌</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">酉</span><span class=\"dp\">亥</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">戌</span><span class=\"dp\">子</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">亥</span><span class=\"dp\">丑</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">子</span><span class=\"dp\">寅</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">丑</span><span class=\"dp\">卯</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">寅</span><span class=\"dp\">辰</span></div><div class=\"panmid\"></div></div></div>\n<p><strong>四课</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sike\"><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第四课</span><span class=\"up w-mu\">卯</span><span class=\"dn w-huo\">巳</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第三课</span><span class=\"up w-huo\">巳</span><span class=\"dn w-tu\">未</span><span class=\"nt\">日支</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第二课</span><span class=\"up w-shui\">子</span><span class=\"dn w-mu\">寅</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第一课</span><span class=\"up w-mu\">寅</span><span class=\"dn w-mu\">乙</span><span class=\"nt\">日干，寄辰</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>三传</strong>　<strong>亥 → 寅 → 巳</strong></p>\n<blockquote><p>原书注：三元胎格·衰元胎 · 乙未日第三局（亥加丑昴星课），家道衰替</p></blockquote>\n<h3 id=\"昴星格-论生男生女\">昴星格：论生男生女</h3>\n<blockquote class=\"cite\"><p><q class=\"yw\">昴星格，刚日生女，或柔日虎视生男，取俯仰而生故也。</q> <span class=\"src\">〔大全三·第 19 法〕</span></p></blockquote>\n<p><strong>白话</strong>　昴星课论生男生女：刚日（阳日）主生女，柔日（阴日）虎视格主生男，取其俯仰而生之故。</p>\n<p>*（原书此格无盘图。）*</p>\n<h3 id=\"胎受克绝格-占产吉凶\">胎受克绝格：占产吉凶</h3>\n<blockquote class=\"cite\"><p><q class=\"yw\">胎受克绝格，胎神临本日及临绝受克。六壬日午加亥，六庚日卯加申，乃胎临本日，占产可言当日便生且安好。或六癸日午加亥，六辛日卯加申，乃胎神临绝受克，占孕占产俱畏。六戊日子加巳，同六甲日亦如前说，且占产稍不畏矣。</q> <span class=\"src\">〔大全三·第 19 法〕</span></p></blockquote>\n<p><strong>白话</strong>　胎神临日、临绝神受克，为胎受克绝格。六壬日午加亥、六庚日卯加申，胎临本日，占产主当日生产，且母子平安。六癸日午加亥、六辛日卯加申，胎神临绝神受克，占孕、占产俱凶。六戊日子加巳，同六甲日亦如前说，占产凶稍轻微。</p>\n<p><strong>盘</strong>　壬子日第 6 局　月将 巳 加占时 戌　（重审）</p>\n<div class=\"panwrap\"><div class=\"pan\"><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">子</span><span class=\"dp\">巳</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">丑</span><span class=\"dp\">午</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">寅</span><span class=\"dp\">未</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">卯</span><span class=\"dp\">申</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">辰</span><span class=\"dp\">酉</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">巳</span><span class=\"dp\">戌</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">午</span><span class=\"dp\">亥</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">未</span><span class=\"dp\">子</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">申</span><span class=\"dp\">丑</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">酉</span><span class=\"dp\">寅</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">戌</span><span class=\"dp\">卯</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">亥</span><span class=\"dp\">辰</span></div><div class=\"panmid\"></div></div></div>\n<p><strong>四课</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sike\"><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第四课</span><span class=\"up w-mu\">寅</span><span class=\"dn w-tu\">未</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第三课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">未</span><span class=\"dn w-shui\">子</span><span class=\"nt\">日支</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第二课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">丑</span><span class=\"dn w-huo\">午</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第一课</span><span class=\"up w-huo\">午</span><span class=\"dn w-shui\">壬</span><span class=\"nt\">日干，寄亥</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>三传</strong>　<strong>午 → 丑 → 申</strong></p>\n<blockquote><p>原书注：胎受克绝格 · 壬子日第六局，胎神午临本日、占产当日生且母子安</p></blockquote>\n<h3 id=\"小产法-断小产之法\">小产法：断小产之法</h3>\n<blockquote class=\"cite\"><p><q class=\"yw\">小产法，如母之年命上神冲克胎神者，纵作生气，必是小产，此法极验。</q> <span class=\"src\">〔大全三·第 19 法〕</span></p></blockquote>\n<p><strong>白话</strong>　小产法，母之年命上神冲克胎神，即使作生气，也必定小产。此法极灵验。</p>\n<p>*（原书此格无盘图。）*</p>\n<h3 id=\"胎神坐长生格-占孕宜-占产凶\">胎神坐长生格：占孕宜、占产凶</h3>\n<blockquote class=\"cite\"><p><q class=\"yw\">胎神坐长生格，如丙丁、戊己日子加申，庚辛日卯加亥，壬癸日午加寅，甲乙日酉加巳，大宜占孕，惟不利占产，占得此者反凶。</q> <span class=\"src\">〔大全三·第 19 法〕</span></p></blockquote>\n<p><strong>白话</strong>　胎神坐长生格，如丙、丁、戊、己日子加申，庚、辛日卯加亥，壬、癸日午加寅，甲、乙日酉加巳，大都宜于占孕，只是不利占产，占产得此反凶。</p>\n<p><strong>盘</strong>　己巳日第 9 局　月将 戌 加占时 午　（涉害）</p>\n<div class=\"panwrap\"><div class=\"pan\"><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">酉</span><span class=\"dp\">巳</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">戌</span><span class=\"dp\">午</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">亥</span><span class=\"dp\">未</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">子</span><span class=\"dp\">申</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">丑</span><span class=\"dp\">酉</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">寅</span><span class=\"dp\">戌</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">卯</span><span class=\"dp\">亥</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">辰</span><span class=\"dp\">子</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">巳</span><span class=\"dp\">丑</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">午</span><span class=\"dp\">寅</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">未</span><span class=\"dp\">卯</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">申</span><span class=\"dp\">辰</span></div><div class=\"panmid\"></div></div></div>\n<p><strong>四课</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sike\"><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第四课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">丑</span><span class=\"dn w-jin\">酉</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第三课</span><span class=\"up w-jin\">酉</span><span class=\"dn w-huo\">巳</span><span class=\"nt\">日支</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第二课</span><span class=\"up w-mu\">卯</span><span class=\"dn w-shui\">亥</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第一课</span><span class=\"up w-shui\">亥</span><span class=\"dn w-tu\">己</span><span class=\"nt\">日干，寄未</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>三传</strong>　<strong>酉 → 丑 → 巳</strong></p>\n<blockquote><p>原书注：胎神坐长生格 · 己巳日第九局，胎神坐长生之上、宜孕不宜产</p></blockquote>\n<h3 id=\"腹胎格-必主有孕\">腹胎格：必主有孕</h3>\n<blockquote class=\"cite\"><p><q class=\"yw\">腹胎格，腹加胎神，丑为腹也。如甲乙日丑加酉，丙丁戊己日丑加子，庚辛日丑加卯，戊己、壬癸日丑加午，如值此，来意妻必有孕，缘胎在腹内，丑为腹之类加临胎神故也。</q> <span class=\"src\">〔大全三·第 19 法〕</span></p></blockquote>\n<p><strong>白话</strong>　丑为腹，腹加胎神，如腹内有胎，故称腹胎格。如甲、乙日丑加酉，丙、丁、戊、己日丑加子，庚、辛日丑加卯，戊、己、壬、癸日丑加午，必主有孕，因丑为腹、加临胎神之故。</p>\n<p><strong>盘</strong>　甲子日第 9 局　月将 戌 加占时 午　（元首）</p>\n<div class=\"panwrap\"><div class=\"pan\"><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">酉</span><span class=\"dp\">巳</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">戌</span><span class=\"dp\">午</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">亥</span><span class=\"dp\">未</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:1;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">子</span><span class=\"dp\">申</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">丑</span><span class=\"dp\">酉</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">寅</span><span class=\"dp\">戌</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:4\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">卯</span><span class=\"dp\">亥</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:3\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">辰</span><span class=\"dp\">子</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:2\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">巳</span><span class=\"dp\">丑</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:4;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">午</span><span class=\"dp\">寅</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:3;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">未</span><span class=\"dp\">卯</span></div><div class=\"gong\" style=\"grid-row:2;grid-column:1\"><span class=\"tj\"></span><span class=\"tp\">申</span><span class=\"dp\">辰</span></div><div class=\"panmid\"></div></div></div>\n<p><strong>四课</strong></p>\n<div class=\"sike\"><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第四课</span><span class=\"up w-jin\">申</span><span class=\"dn w-tu\">辰</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第三课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">辰</span><span class=\"dn w-shui\">子</span><span class=\"nt\">日支</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第二课</span><span class=\"up w-tu\">戌</span><span class=\"dn w-huo\">午</span></div><div class=\"ke\"><span class=\"lb\">第一课</span><span class=\"up w-huo\">午</span><span class=\"dn w-mu\">甲</span><span class=\"nt\">日干，寄寅</span></div></div>\n<p><strong>三传</strong>　<strong>辰 → 申 → 子</strong></p>\n<blockquote><p>原书注：腹胎格 · 甲子日第九局，丑（腹）加酉（甲胎）、必主有孕</p></blockquote>\n<h3 id=\"腹空格-占产速生-占孕胎损\">腹空格：占产速生、占孕胎损</h3>\n<blockquote class=\"cite\"><p><q class=\"yw\">腹空格，如天盘之丑作空或落空，如占产则生速，缘腹空而必已诞其右子，占孕必损孕。</q> <span class=\"src\">〔大全三·第 19 法〕</span></p></blockquote>\n<p><strong>白话</strong>　腹空格，丑加胎神，天盘之丑作空或落空，占产则速生，占孕必损孕。</p>\n<p>*（原书此格无盘图。）*</p>\n<h3 id=\"全伤格-子母俱凶\">全伤格：子母俱凶</h3>\n<blockquote class=\"cite\"><p><q class=\"yw\">全伤格，支干全伤，子母俱凶，独支受伤害母，独干受伤害子。如产期以本月之内破胎之日生，或害胎之日生，或刑胎之日生，或月内生气之日生，或以子息爻中长生之日生，或以五行养处生。如甲乙日以戌为养神，或以逐季之天喜神所临之日生妙矣，夫天喜者，乃逐季之养神也。以上不利占孕，反有损。</q> <span class=\"src\">〔大全三·第 19 法〕</span></p></blockquote>\n<p><strong>白话</strong>　全伤格，支干全伤，主母子俱凶；支伤主害母，干伤主害子。占产期，应在本月之内破胎之日、害胎之日、刑胎之日、月内生气之日、子息爻中长生之日，或五行养处。如甲乙日以戌为养神，或逐季之天喜神所临之日生（天喜为逐季之养神）。以上不利占孕，占孕则反而有损。【五行养神】木（甲乙）戌、火（丙丁）丑、土（戊己）丑、金（庚辛）辰、水（壬癸）未。</p>\n<p>*（原书此格无盘图。）*</p>\n<h3 id=\"纳音法-以纳音占产期\">纳音法：以纳音占产期</h3>\n<blockquote class=\"cite\"><p><q class=\"yw\">纳音法，又妻本命纳音之胎神，冲破之日生产尤验。</q> <span class=\"src\">〔大全三·第 19 法〕</span></p></blockquote>\n<p><strong>白话</strong>　纳音法，指以妻子本命纳音之胎神来断生产之日，应在胎神受冲破之日尤为灵验。</p>\n<p>*（原书此格无盘图。）*</p>\n<h3 id=\"夹定三传格-母子不保\">夹定三传格：母子不保</h3>\n<blockquote class=\"cite\"><p><q class=\"yw\">夹定三传格，如干支夹定三传，或初末六合，如占产，子母俱不可保，缘气塞于中故也。如约母之年命透出支干之外，可免母之凶也。</q> <span class=\"src\">〔大全三·第 19 法〕</span></p></blockquote>\n<p><strong>白话</strong>　夹定三传格，如干支夹定三传，或初传与末传作六合，占产则主母子都不可保。因气堵塞于中，如果母之年命透出支干之外，母凶可免。</p>\n<p>*（原书此格无盘图。）*</p>\n<h3 id=\"旧版-App-的说法\">旧版 App 的说法</h3>\n<p><strong>旧版主题释义</strong>（婚孕）：日胎神作妻财又逢月生气，主妻有孕</p>\n<p><strong>定义</strong>　日干之胎神作日之妻财，又逢月内之生气。</p>\n<p>⭐ 占妻必孕；胎神临妻之年命或临支上尤好，妻财作生气纵不作胎神亦可用。</p>\n<hr>", "bf20": "<h2 id=\"第-20-法-胎财死气损胎推-占孕不育\">第 20 法　胎财死气损胎推：占孕不育</h2>\n<h3 id=\"胎财死气格-胎必有损\">胎财死气格：胎必有损</h3>\n<blockquote class=\"cite\"><p><q class=\"yw\">戊己日子为胎财，七月死气在子；庚辛日卯为胎财，十月死气在卯；壬癸日午为胎财，正月死气在午；甲乙日酉为胎财，四月死气在酉，甲戌旬鬼胎空亡，余亦仿此，全如前篇论，但凡胎神作月内之死气，妇孕不育。</q> <span class=\"src\">〔大全三·第 20 法〕</span></p></blockquote>\n<p><strong>白话</strong>　胎神又作妻财、逢当月死气，其胎必损。如戊、己日子为胎神又作日财，七月占，死气在子，占孕不育、占胎必损。庚、辛日卯木为胎财，十月占，死气在卯；壬、癸日午为胎财，正月占，死气在午；甲、乙日酉为胎财，四月占，死气在酉。其中甲戌旬鬼胎空亡，其余以此类推。但凡胎神逢当月死气，胎不可保。</p>\n<p>*（原书此格无盘图。）*</p>\n<h3 id=\"旧版-App-的说法\">旧版 App 的说法</h3>\n<p><strong>旧版主题释义</strong>（婚孕）：胎神作月内死气，妇孕不育、有损</p>\n<p><strong>定义</strong>　胎神作月内之死气。</p>\n<p>⭐ 妇孕不育、必有损；如约母之年命透出支干之外，可免母凶。</p>\n<hr>"});